# Template development

- **Jinja2**: Use `{{ variable }}` for output, `{% if condition %}...{% endif %}` for conditionals. See [Jinja2 docs](https://jinja.palletsprojects.com/).
- **Copier**: Variables come from prompts and `.copier-answers.yml`. Schema in [copier.yml](src/repoman/main_template/copier.yml).
- **File associations**: `.py.jinja` and `**/*.py{% endif %}.jinja` get Python highlighting (see config/vscode/settings.json).
- **Exclusions**: Ruff excludes `src/repoman/main_template`; template files are not linted directly.
